{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>$48/件!批底鬆脆+煉奶焦糖醬</p><p>西貢都有得食大熱香蕉拖肥批！</p><p>香蕉拖肥批熱潮不斷，最近小編喺threads見到西貢海濱公園有間新開Cafe「KUNG KUNG KIOSK」 @kungkungkiosk ，佢哋其中一款招牌甜品就係香蕉拖肥批。每日自家手工製，限量供應，周末去西貢chill不妨一試！</p><p>自家製香蕉焦糖拖肥批$48件</p><p>小店嘅香蕉焦糖拖肥批$48件，每日新鮮製作，在消化餅底層塗上一層煉奶焦糖醬 ，中間放上軟熟香蕉後，再唧上紐西蘭鮮忌廉，最後曬上可可粉，口感輕盈幼滑，批底鬆脆，甜品控大滿足！</p><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720565505239916_21335788146a869829a918c.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720567592437371_8402081656a8698387806d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720569068549463_2908868866a86984a3e0d4.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720570854680558_7886931736a869855bbac9.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720571956991963_11847182086a86986391939.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720573352456654_19518890056a8698845c05d.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"0\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/178720576640121582_2311537926a86989e9b6f1.jpg\"/><figcaption>0</figcaption></figure><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文 新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T06:19:01.685692+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":325,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none"}}